featuring new environments, tons of details, and even some snazzy new getups for our professors and pupils.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, evil genius DJ Doseone is back with a sick round of fresh beats to chill and study to. The all-new OST provides the perfect audio background for puzzling.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So whatcha waiting for? It\u2019s time to go\u2026Back 2 School!</p>",
